There is a way to put monsters (and items) on a migrating list. When the 
player character changes a level the migrating list is checked if the 
monster (or item) should be relocated onto that level. One could define 
a new way to migrate the named demons when they are left behind.

For example: A named demon, on the migrating list, is always brought 
onto the level the player enters and if it's its homelevel turn it 
hostile. Those named demons that don't have a homelevel would be always 
hostile. No more leaving named demons behind.

